      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not really constant though, it's just that specific heavy burning feeling when i'm active. like if i walk up a flight of steps it hits me and then when i sit on the couch it's fine. is it really worth going to a doctor for something that just goes away on its own after a minute or two? sounds like it's just my stomach acting up. maybe i should just take a higher dose of pepcid to be safe?",
